 \"What is the profession of Pier Crescenzi?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 101, \"text\": \"Pier Paolo Crescenzi Pier Paolo Crescenzi (1572 – 19 February 1645) was an Italian Catholic cardinal.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"start\": 102, \"end\": 234, \"text\": \"Crescenzi was born in 1572, the son of Virgilio Crescenzi, Baron of Montorio, and Costanza del Drago, of the Marquises of Riofreddo.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"start\": 235, \"end\": 292, \"text\": \"He was the brother of artist Giovanni Battista Crescenzi.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"start\": 293, \"end\": 401, \"text\": \"He was educated at the University of Perugia and earned a doctorate \\\"in utroque iure\\\" (Civil and Canon Law).\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"start\": 402, \"end\": 542, \"text\": \"Very little is known about Crescenzi's early life, but on 17 August 1611 he was elevated to cardinal and installed as Cardinal-Priest of Ss.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"start\": 543, \"end\": 561, \"text\": \"Nereo ed Achilleo.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"start\": 562, \"end\": 597, \"text\": \"In 1612, he was appointed Bishop of\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 83, \"text\": \"17 August 1611 he was elevated to cardinal and installed as Cardinal-Priest of Ss .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01\", \"start\": 84, \"end\": 103, \"text\": \"Nereo ed Achilleo .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01\", \"start\": 104, \"end\": 190, \"text\": \"On 4 Jul 1612 , he was appointed during the papacy of Pope Paul V as Bishop of Rieti .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01\", \"start\": 191, \"end\": 436, \"text\": \"[ 4 ] On 15 Jul 1612 , he was consecrated bishop by Bonifazio Caetani , Bishop of Cassano all'Jonio , with Fabio Biondi , Titular Patriarch of Jerusalem , and Galeazzo Sanvitale , Archbishop Emeritus of Bari-Canosa , serving as co-consecrators .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01\", \"start\": 437, \"end\": 496, \"text\": \"[ 4 ] On 17 Mar 1621 , he was appointed Bishop of Orvieto .\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01\", \"start\": 497, \"end\": 506, \"text\": \"In 1629 ,\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 783, \"text\": \": Q19088 wikidata : Q215627 wikidata : Q36180 wikidata : Q5 wikidata : Q729 dbo : Animal dbo : Eukaryote dbo : Species schema : Person yago : WikicatLatin-languageWriters yago : WikicatMedievalJurists yago : WikicatPeopleFromBologna yago : Adjudicator109769636 yago : Adult109605289 yago : Agronomist109780120 yago : CausalAgent100007347 yago : Communicator109610660 yago : Expert109617867 yago : Hunter110193026 yago : Judge110225219 yago : Jurist110227985 yago : Lawyer110249950 yago : LivingThing100004258 yago : Object100002684 yago : Official110372373 yago : Organism100004475 yago : Person100007846 yago : PhysicalEntity100001930 yago : Professional110480253 yago : WikicatHunters yago : WikicatItalianAgronomists yago : WikicatItalianJudges yago : WikicatItalianJurists yago :\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Pier Crescenzi\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Pier Crescenzi's profession is that of a Catholic cardinal.\", \"answer\": \"Catholic cardinal\", \"quote\": \"Pier Paolo Crescenzi Pier Paolo Crescenzi (1572 – 19 February 1645) was an Italian Catholic cardinal.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Pier Crescenzi\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Pier Crescenzi's profession is Bishop.\", \"answer\": \"Bishop\", \"quote\": \"On 4 Jul 1612 , he was appointed during the papacy of Pope Paul V as Bishop of Rieti . [ 4 ] On 15 Jul 1612 , he was consecrated bishop by Bonifazio Caetani , Bishop of Cassano all'Jonio , with Fabio Biondi , Titular Patriarch of Jerusalem , and Galeazzo Sanvitale , Archbishop Emeritus of Bari-Canosa , serving as co-consecrators . [ 4 ] On 17 Mar 1621 , he was appointed Bishop of Orvieto .\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0086-afbc0e10f14a:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Pier Crescenzi\", \"scope\": \"profession\", \"claim\": \"Pier Crescenzi is a judge.\", \"answer\": \"Judge\", \"quote\": \": Q19088 wikidata : Q215627 wikidata : Q36180 wikidata : Q5 wikidata : Q729 dbo : Animal dbo : Eukaryote dbo : Species schema : Person yago : WikicatLatin-languageWriters yago : WikicatMedievalJurists yago : WikicatPeopleFromBologna yago : Adjudicator109769636 yago : Adult109605289 yago : Agronomist109780120 yago : CausalAgent100007347 yago : Communicator109610660 yago : Expert109617867 yago : Hunter110193026 yago : Judge110225219 yago : Jurist110227985 yago : Lawyer110249950 yago : LivingThing100004258 yago : Object100002684 yago : Official110372373 yago : Organism100004475 yago : Person100007846 yago : PhysicalEntity100001930 yago : Professional110480253 yago : WikicatHunters yago : WikicatItalianAgronomists yago : WikicatItalianJudges yago : WikicatItalianJurists yago :\", \"original_document_number\": 3}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Catholic cardinal\"